    "id": "member.placeHold",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "title": "Place Account Hold",
    "description": "Signs on as a supervisor, opens Member Inquiry, searches by Member Number (memberId), selects the member, and places a restricted Account Hold on a specified share (share) with a given reason code (reasonCode) and notes. It commits the irreversible 'Apply Hold' action on the review screen and returns the resulting confirmation/reference number as output 'confirmationNumber'. Requires operator credentials (operatorId/operatorPassword) resolved from the environment.",
